<title>UK: Hewetson forecasts annual profit rise.</title>
<headline>Hewetson forecasts annual profit rise.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Construction industry supplier Hewetson Plc said on Wednesday that pretax profits for year ended March 31, 1997 would not be less than 2.4 million stg.  </p>
<p>It said in a statement that earnings per share on a fully diluted basis would not be less than 9.8p per share. Results are due on June 24.</p>
<p>The firm made pre-tax profits of 813,000 in the previous year.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
